      "writtenOn": "2024-11-29T08:05:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Doesn\u0027t seem like the [gerrit-ci-script changes](https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/c/gerrit-ci-scripts/+/443061) are automatically deployed.\nHow/when are they deployed?",
      "revId": "1029347e609b6c24eddcdf61e55fe7ad56f9a3c5",
