      "writtenOn": "2024-11-29T08:36:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "See [1] and [2] where the changes on the CI were announced. Because of the inherent security risks of having Jenkins exposed to the internet, there are *no* stored secrets, apart from the feedback to the build verification made with an untrusted user.\n\nYou can deploy the changes at any time using your Jenkins token on the UI and trigger the Job manually.\n\n[1] https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vQ6oF1Bp5voqymlV2U0UReQ7LOpMU_7HT7Wmz-GsD5uWb-arLrCNu_h-yQTGi-Q-0BWGqv7nwSIrsvZ/pub\n[2] https://groups.google.com/g/repo-discuss/c/_z52lwwh5yg/m/U6NaAVK6AgAJ",
      "parentUuid": "d6d4cbc8_60f5555c",
      "revId": "1029347e609b6c24eddcdf61e55fe7ad56f9a3c5",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
