      "writtenOn": "2024-11-29T08:58:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know how to deploy gerrit-ci-script changes to gerrit-ci.gerritforge.com and cannot seem to find any relevant documentation in the repo itself, could you give me some pointers?",
